    |-------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
    |                 |                     |When '1' the output from the associated|
    |                 |                     |comparator will need to be 1 to affect |
    |      20         |   BC0_COMP_HIGH     |the decoding of this condition.        |
    |                 |                     |Conversely, a '0' here requires a '0'  |
